{title: Aaiye Meherbaan}
{artist: Asha Bhosle O P Nayyar}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C],        Aaiye meherbaan
[C] [F],        baithiye jaane jaan
[F] [G],        Shauk se liijiyegi
[C],        ishq ki imthihaan
[C],        Aaiye meherbaan
[C] [F],        Kaise ho tum naujwaan
[F] [C],        kitne haseen mehmaan
[C] [F],        Kaise karun mein bayaan
[G] [C],        dil ki nahi hai zubaan
[C],        Aaiye meherbaan...
[C] [F],        Dekha machal ke jidhar
[F] [C],        bijli gira di udhar
[C] [F],        Kis ka jala aashiyana
[G] [C],        bijli ko ye kya khabar
[C],        Aaiye meherbaan...
